participant User "User" actor
participant Agent "AI Agent"
participant MCP "MCP Tools"
participant API "External Service"
msg User -> Agent solid filled #1 "Request IP attribution"
msg Agent -> MCP solid filled #2 "Query ASN & Reputation"
msg MCP -> API solid filled #3 "Fetch Whois / OTX / AbuseIPDB"
msg API -> MCP dotted filled #4 "Return threat indicators"
msg MCP -> Agent dotted filled #5 "Formatted intelligence data"
msg Agent -> Agent solid filled #6 "Correlate & Assess confidence"
msg Agent -> User dotted filled #7 "Present investigation report"
